{"id":"427521","name":"荠菜豆腐羹","author":"花擦擦","authorId":"1492203","desc":"","cover":"images/427521/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豆腐","amount":"1盒"},{"name":"荠菜","amount":"100克"},{"name":"土豆","amount":"1个"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"半根"},{"name":"肉末","amount":"50克"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"味精","amount":"适量"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"所有食材。","img":"images/427521/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"荠菜洗净切碎，胡萝卜洗净切小块，土豆去皮洗净切小块。","img":"images/427521/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中放水，放入胡萝卜和土豆煮开至熟。","img":"images/427521/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入肉末煮开。","img":"images/427521/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入荠菜煮开。","img":"images/427521/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再放入豆腐煮开。","img":"images/427521/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放适量的盐煮开。","img":"images/427521/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入淀粉勾芡。","img":"images/427521/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"最后放入味精拌匀即可。","img":"images/427521/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}